/Title (Observation: Global Histogram Equalization enhances overall contrast but can over-amplify noise and cause loss of detail in very bright/dark regions, since it applies a single transformation to the whole image. CLAHE applies equalization locally \(per tile\) with a clip limit, giving more balanced contrast enhancement without over-amplifying noise in any single region.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 875 0 R
